              <td>Column 3</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Provision(s)</td>
              <td>Commencement</td>
              <td>Date/Details</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>1.  Sections 1 to 3 and anything in this Act not elsewhere covered by this table</td>
              <td>The day this Act receives the Royal Assent.</td>
              <td>1 July 2013</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>2.  Schedule 1, items 1 and 2</td>
              <td>The day this Act receives the Royal Assent.</td>
              <td>1 July 2013</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>3.  Schedule 1, item 3</td>
              <td>22 September 2009.</td>
              <td>22 September 2009</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>4.  Schedule 1, items 4, 5 and 6</td>
